<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">    daily                      </span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;"># 每天轮转一次（也可 size 100M 按大小）</span></span>
